msgstr "https://fines-finest.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: fines-finest-booking.php
msgid "Appointment booking in your own design, with Google Calendar sync, Google Meet, confirmation emails and Brevo. All data stays in your own WordPress database."
msgstr "Terminbuchung im eigenen Corporate Design, mit Google-Kalender-Sync, Google Meet, Bestätigungsmails und Brevo-Anbindung. Alle Daten bleiben in der eigenen WordPress-Datenbank."

#. Author of the plugin
#: fines-finest-booking.php
msgid "Fines Finest"
msgstr "Fines Finest"

#: fines-finest-booking.php:118
msgid "I have read the privacy policy and agree to the processing of my data to arrange the appointment."
msgstr "Ich habe die Datenschutzerklärung gelesen und bin mit der Verarbeitung meiner Daten zur Terminabwicklung einverstanden."

